  offer: Take the field report west along the road to Willowford. Envoy Tamsin has a desk near the inn and spring. Tell her what you found at the two watchposts; she will send a careful account to the Verdant Council.
  activeDialogue: Follow the western road from Cinderwatch into Steamroot Vale. Meet Envoy Tamsin just north of Willowford's main road, beside the expedition banner.
  turnInDialogue: Willowford now holds the expedition's first complete field record. The reason for the dragon's appearance remains an open question.
  locationHint: Speak to Envoy Tamsin in Willowford, north of the spring and east of the inn.
  turnInHint: Acknowledge Tamsin's conversation to file the field report.
